{"id":"n62652-1-23","stage":1,"title":"바르다 · 抹","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62652-1-23-1","ko":"다리에 왜 약을 바르고 있어?","zh":"你为什么在腿上涂药啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"다리에","meaning":"腿，下肢","explanation":"다리：腿，下肢；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"다리","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62840","senseId":"1","lemma":"다리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바르고","meaning":"抹，搽","explanation":"바르다：抹，搽；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"바르다","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62652","senseId":"1","lemma":"바르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"982037b144c2b329","term":"다리","zh":"腿，下肢","audio":"/audio/982037b144c2b329e189.mp3","entryId":"62840","definition":"人或动物身体下的，做站、走、跳的动作的身体部位。","pronunciation":["다리"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"3b42ecf8717cc7fd","term":"바르다","zh":"抹，搽","audio":"/audio/3b42ecf8717cc7fd3927.mp3","entryId":"62652","definition":"把液体或粉末等置于物体表面揉擦，使其被均匀涂抹。","pronunciation":["바르다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/418d21ce5e60c1035154.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62652-1-23-2","ko":"아까 뛰다가 넘어져서 상처가 나서.","zh":"刚才跑步时摔倒了，所以擦伤了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아까","meaning":"刚才，方才，刚刚","explanation":"아까：刚才，方才，刚刚","readings":[{"term":"아까","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65974","senseId":"1","lemma":"아까","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뛰다가","meaning":"跑，奔跑","explanation":"뛰다：跑，奔跑；다가：表示原有动作或状态中途转为另一情况。","readings":[{"term":"뛰다","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74124","senseId":"1","lemma":"뛰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넘어져서","meaning":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","explanation":"넘어지다：跌倒，倒下，摔倒；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"넘어지다","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62363","senseId":"1","lemma":"넘어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상처가","meaning":"伤口，伤","explanation":"상처：伤口，伤；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"상처","audio":"/audio/005223fd14eafcaf1ee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62979","senseId":"1","lemma":"상처","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나서.","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"5dbe3d17e9e85489","term":"아까","zh":"刚才，方才，刚刚","audio":"/audio/5dbe3d17e9e854897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"96e5ecf6b0d33341","term":"뛰다","zh":"跑，奔跑","audio":"/audio/96e5ecf6b0d33341a17f.mp3","entryId":"74124","definition":"快速挪动双脚，迅速向前行进。","pronunciation":["뛰다"]},{"id":"b95cf11ab79489da","term":"넘어지다","zh":"跌倒，倒下，摔倒","audio":"/audio/b95cf11ab79489dac5a0.mp3","entryId":"62363","definition":"站立着的人或物失去重心，倾向一边而倒下。","pronunciation":["너머지다"]},{"id":"005223fd14eafcaf","term":"상처","zh":"伤口，伤","audio":"/audio/005223fd14eafcaf1ee3.mp3","entryId":"62979","definition":"身体受伤而生出的伤处。","pronunciation":["상처"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/378ded03775b33f105e6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.12,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62652","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":36,"sequenceScore":1.5707,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你为什么在腿上涂药啊？","刚才跑步时摔倒了，所以擦伤了。","明明酒量不好，为什么喝这么多？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你为什么在腿上涂药啊？","刚才跑步时摔倒了，所以擦伤了。","明明酒量不好，为什么喝这么多？"],"answer":1}]}
